00:23:06,780 --> 00:23:08,540
this is the most important thing,
这一点是最重要的是，

449
00:23:08,540 --> 00:23:10,460
how to talk with people, how to negotiate,
如何与人交流，如何协商，

450
00:23:10,460 --> 00:23:11,980
how to compromise.
如何妥协。

451
00:23:11,980 --> 00:23:14,140
We are seeing an effect perhaps that,
我们正看到一种或许这样的现象，

452
00:23:15,140 --> 00:23:17,100
in civility and modern politics today,
在文明与现代政治之中，

453
00:23:17,100 --> 00:23:19,020
