00:23:22,380 --> 00:23:25,040
I remember we were on a trip to,
我记得我们曾去了一趟，

456
00:23:25,040 --> 00:23:27,340
I believe it we were wearing Birmingham.
我相信我们去的是伯明翰。

457
00:23:27,340 --> 00:23:31,380
We took the show down there and we did a public event.
我们在那里参加了一场活动，并举办了一场公开活动。

458
00:23:31,380 --> 00:23:33,760
If I got the city wrong, forgive me.
如果我搞错了城市，就原谅我吧。

459
00:23:33,760 --> 00:23:35,660
But there was a young woman in the audience
但现场有一位年轻女性

