00:24:02,180 --> 00:24:04,860
I've been thinking about this a lot as a journalist
我作为一名记者，一直反复思考这个问题。

471
00:24:04,860 --> 00:24:09,380
working on a show that often covers the federal landscape,
我正在制作一档经常报道联邦层面议题的节目。

