00:24:12,440 --> 00:24:17,400
ensuring that the public feels that they can use the tools
确保公众觉得他们能够使用这些工具

474
00:24:17,400 --> 00:24:20,100
that we are attempting to provide them with,
我们试图为他们提供的工具

475
00:24:20,100 --> 00:24:23,860
That, I think, comes by way of feeling empowerment
我认为，这源于一种被赋权的感觉

